@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@
+# Copy to .env.linux (Git ignored). Use UTF-8 and quote secrets containing # or spaces.
+# Linux Desktop artifacts are built unsigned, so no signing, notarization, or certificate
+# setting applies. Credential file paths may be absolute or relative to apps/desktop.
+# Values are not shell-expanded.
+DSH_DESKTOP_APP_ID=com.deepseek.harness
+
+# Debian and RPM control files name a maintainer and a project URL, and fpm refuses to build either
+# format without them; AppImage carries neither. The maintainer is whoever built this package, not the
+# upstream author, and GitHub's noreply address is a valid address for that field. Required only when
+# the run selects the deb or rpm format.
+DSH_DESKTOP_LINUX_MAINTAINER="ffyfox <299493445+ffyfox@users.noreply.github.com>"
+DSH_DESKTOP_LINUX_HOMEPAGE="https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness"
+
+# The mandatory-update policy channel is Windows and macOS only. The policy service identifies its
+# Desktop clients as desktop-win or desktop-mac and has no Linux identity, and a Linux release carries
+# no update channel, so no policy decision could drive an action. A Linux application therefore embeds
+# no policy and polls nothing: DSH_DESKTOP_AUTO_UPDATE_ENV, both
+# DSH_DESKTOP_MANDATORY_UPDATE_*_ORIGIN settings, and DSH_DESKTOP_MANDATORY_UPDATE_CONFIG do not apply.
+
+# Optional npm registry for the bundled dsh runtime install; defaults to https://registry.npmjs.org/.
+# A local mirror such as https://registry.npmmirror.com speeds up repeated local packages.
+# DSH_DESKTOP_NPM_REGISTRY=https://registry.npmmirror.com
+
+# Optional upload configuration; packaging does not require these credentials.
+# DOWNLOAD_TEST_ORIGIN=
+# Required for test releases: 32 lowercase hexadecimal characters from a secure random generator.
+# DOWNLOAD_TEST_RELEASE_ID=
+# DOWNLOAD_TEST_COS_BUCKET=
+# DOWNLOAD_TEST_COS_SECRET_ID=
+# DOWNLOAD_TEST_COS_SECRET_KEY=
+# DOWNLOAD_PROD_COS_BUCKET=
+# DOWNLOAD_PROD_COS_SECRET_ID=
+# DOWNLOAD_PROD_COS_SECRET_KEY=
